    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements.</strong> You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective.</strong> Encounter and defeat strange creatures such as <strong>zombies, aliens, werewolves, vampires, and mutated creatures</strong> as you progress through each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.poster.avif?t=1751786836\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.webm?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.mp4?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect supplies and craft items or weapons.</strong> Search for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock new levels by defeating the various bosses you encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.poster.avif?t=1751786836\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.webm?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.mp4?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey to the world of Zombies and Strangers with a dynamic day-and-night cycle environment</strong>. Experience each level in <strong>spring, summer, autumn, or winter</strong> <strong>season</strong> and encounter different enemy types and bosses as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 2D pixel art, Zombies and Strangers offers a nostalgic, yet fresh visual style.</strong> it features dynamic effects, fluid pixel animations, and a wide range of enemy types. <strong>2D top-down Environment</strong> ranges from <strong>towns, cities, rocky mountains and beaches</strong>. The game is designed with classic arcade aesthetics, along with fast-paced top-down action and colorful visual effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements.</strong> You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective.</strong> Encounter and defeat strange creatures such as <strong>zombies, aliens, werewolves, vampires, and mutated creatures</strong> as you progress through each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.poster.avif?t=1751786836\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.webm?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.mp4?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect supplies and craft items or weapons.</strong> Search for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock new levels by defeating the various bosses you encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.poster.avif?t=1751786836\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.webm?t=1751786836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a16